WEBVTT

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.180
The power of light is increasing.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.630
The two stones whose presence have 
disappeared and the two stones

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:31.450
that those wretched fools from the 
Field of Light ran away with...

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:35.500
We can't let them get any more of the stones.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.780
We can't let the Field of 
Light regain its power.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:45.060
We don't have much time left.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:50.510
At this rate, sooner or later the existence 
of Dotsuku Zone itself will be...

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:55.230
I know that, but I want you to 
let me do as I please for now.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.710
I have my own way of doing things.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.670
He's just a child...

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:03.370
The only thing full-fledged 
about him is his mouth.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:05.530
At any rate, now is our chance.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.480
Leave it to me.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:13.840
The stones...

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:20.670
We must get all seven stones that 
will produce the Power of Creation.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:24.960
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:30.600
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.870
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:37.840
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.710
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:42.610
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:46.520
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.120
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:53.930
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:56.030
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:59.800
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.800
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.370
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.540
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.410
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:18.680
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:22.290
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:25.090
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:27.990
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.560
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.630
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.950
Thank you, Muromachi-san.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:50.330
Have a nice day.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.390
It's up to you, Misumi!

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:07.240
Having Dotsuku Zone attack us when we 
were on our family vacation was the pits.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:25.280
We don't know when they'll 
come after us again...

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.620
We can't let our guard down.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.810
Nagisa!

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.060
Got it!

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:56.040
That was awesome, Nagisa!

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.110
You did it!

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.080
The school superstar...?

00:03:59.080 --> 00:03:59.980
Really?

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:01.920
Let's go!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:15.270
"FULL THROTTLE STRESS! IT'S 
HARD BEING A SUPERSTAR"

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:40.700
Way to go!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.720
Just what you'd expect from 
Verone Academy's superstar!

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.960
I must admit... That was a nice shot!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.640
Let's get on with the game!

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.300
Verone Academy won it in straight sets!

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.400
Just what you'd expect of our superstar!

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:20.210
She sure did it, didn't she?

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.800
As an all-around athlete, you're 
just as good as she is, Nagisa.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:28.170
But Yuka is smart, pretty and 
comes from a rich family.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.470
She's perfect.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:33.240
But wasn't Yuka on the tennis team?

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.140
No... No... You're wrong.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:40.080
Yuka is just helping the tennis team 
get into the district tournament.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.140
Then is she on the volleyball team?

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:45.180
No... She's just helping them 
beat Otakagu Girls' School.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:48.300
Then what does she really belong to?

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:51.410
Was it the tea ceremony club?

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:54.430
Wasn't it the wind instrument club?

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:55.810
Come to think of it,

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:59.990
I thought I saw her making a speech 
at the English conversation club...

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:10.860
Odajima-san is actually in the science club.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:15.030
She's been in the science club since 
she was a first-year student here.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:16.170
That's awesome.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:19.480
She's not only accomplished in 
sports, but culture and music, too.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.360
That's true.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.490
Yukishiro-san...?

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:25.800
The volleyball match was awesome.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:26.660
Thank you.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.310
Never mind that... How are 
things at the science club?

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.770
I'm sorry I haven't shown up at all recently.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.880
Everyone's working hard.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:36.570
Just leave it to Honoka... 
Everything will be okay.

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:39.030
You're the one who made the 
basket earlier, aren't you?

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:41.010
That's right. I'm Nagisa Misumi.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:44.360
You handled it beautifully.

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:46.320
It was nothing...

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.110
But if it had been slightly off, 
it would have disrupted the match.

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:50.330
You should be more careful.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.220
I'm sorry.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.740
Excuse me.

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:03.970
Do you think she dislikes me?

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:06.790
Of course not! Odajima-san's very serious,

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:08.890
so she was just cautioning you.

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:10.240
You think so?

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:16.320
Oh, no! Is it that late already?

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:26.520
Of all days to be late! This is the pits.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.960
I'll take a shortcut.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.330
It's Yuka...

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.590
Leave it to a rich girl... 
She goes to school in style.

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:52.690
I don't have time to be impressed.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:57.050
I wonder if Misumi-san noticed me...

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:00.630
You can drop me off here, Muromachi-san.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.520
But we're almost there.

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:06.500
It's okay. I'm sorry you 
had to take me to school two days in a row.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.370
I'll be more careful from now on.

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.740
It would be unforgivable if 
they found out that the school

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:14.170
superstar had overslept, and 
had to be driven to school.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:33.720
Safe!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.050
You're out!

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:38.100
You get to clean the blackboards 
during lunch for being tardy.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:48.790
I'll help you.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:51.970
Do it like this...

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.860
Odajima-san...

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:20.330
You two seem to be having a lot of fun.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.630
Would you like to join us?

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:25.140
It's fun.

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:29.150
I wouldn't mind joining you 
if I were in grade school.

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:33.920
Grade school?

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:37.000
She dislikes me, after all.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.540
Of course she doesn't.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:39.420
You think so?

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.060
She's not like that.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.280
You two don't understand how hard

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:47.540
it is to be the school superstar, do you?

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.760
I'd better hurry before 
the piano teacher arrives.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.990
After that, the English conversation 
teacher will be coming, too.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.720
They're all having fun...

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:20.630
If only I were free to be like them...

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:30.140
No... I'm Yuka Odajima, the 
Verone Academy superstar.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:32.050
I can't ruin that image.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:39.910
Shall I resolve your problem?

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:46.120
A fortune-teller around here?

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.780
I don't have any problems.

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:51.000
I wonder about that.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.320
I see it written all over your face.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:58.460
"I wish I could play freely 
like an ordinary girl."

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.310
This is going to be interesting.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.460
It looks like we made it through 
the day safely, doesn't it?

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:01.260
It does, doesn't it?

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:03.240
Nagisa! Nagisa!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.240
What is it? Not here!

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:06.200
Sleep for a little while longer.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:09.180
I feel something evil in the air mepo.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:12.140
It's getting closer and closer mipo.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:30.960
Odajima-san...?

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:36.220
It's getting closer mipo!

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:40.040
Odajima-san!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:49.260
She dislikes me, after all.

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:52.750
Don't you think she's acting strange?

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.120
You think so?

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:59.180
It's terrible mipo!

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:02.090
The feeling of evil is getting 
stronger and stronger mepo!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:02.650
Which way?

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:04.110
This way mipo!

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:04.110
This way mepo!

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:05.240
Wait!

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.400
We'll go with whoever wins!

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:13.600
This way!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.030
I'm sorry!

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:17.970
Odajima-san...?

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:24.170
How can that be! She just went that way...!

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:27.510
She dislikes me, after all!

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:29.220
No, she doesn't.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.790
Odajima-san...?

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:37.150
What in the...?

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:39.360
A whole bunch of Odajimas...?

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:43.580
No way!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:48.320
Play all you want, Zakenna!

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:52.430
Give me back my skateboard!

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:18.290
This is Dotsuku Zone's doing mepo!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.170
That's right mipo!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.640
You mean you only realized it now?

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:25.210
So it was you after all.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.950
What have you done to Odajima-san?

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:33.550
She was stressed out, so I just 
had Zakenna possess her shadow,

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:35.880
so she could play to her heart's content.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:52.190
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.630
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.490
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:52.140
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.970
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:59.200
Go back to where you came from!

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:04.830
Come back here!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.280
I won't let you get away!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.640
I think she should be around here somewhere.

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:41.240
I'm sure she hates me!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:44.750
I told you... that's not the problem here.

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:55.500
It's creepy!

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.680
Don't push so hard!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.200
Look the other way!

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:04.750
Let me out of here! Let me out!

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:09.510
I wouldn't be so rough if I were you...

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:10.970
Why not?

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:14.450
The real Yuka Odajima is in there somewhere.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.490
If you should hurt the real one,

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.370
you'll be in big trouble, won't you?

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:20.180
That can't be...

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.150
The real Odajima-san...?

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.790
If you'll just hand over the Prism Stones,

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:28.550
I'd be willing to give her back to you.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.460
You can't do that mepo!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.460
You can't do that mipo!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.430
At this rate...

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:37.120
Don't give in mipo!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:37.890
Hang in there mepo!

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:44.650
She said Zakenna possessed 
Odajima-san's shadow, didn't she?

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.130
Which means...

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.230
That one!

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.000
I'm going to beat the living 
daylights out of you!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.950
No! That's the real Odajima-san!

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.160
The real one?

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:10.160
What are you doing? Get them!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:14.440
The real one is getting 
mixed in with the fake ones.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.420
White! Do you have something to write with?

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:18.560
Something to write with?

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:19.640
I know!

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.160
Black!

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:25.340
Thank you!

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.150
What are you doing?

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.110
I'm marking the real one.

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:37.810
What do you think?

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:43.760
Now we can fight without 
holding back, can't we?

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:44.640
That's true.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:46.670
Take care of Odajima-san.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:48.610
Let's go, Odajima-san.

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:51.580
Come on! I'll take all of you on!

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:54.230
Just as you wish!

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:56.500
Zakenna!

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:05.490
Zakenna!

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:07.860
It turned into one!

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:10.160
One isn't as much trouble to handle.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:28.330
Za...  za... za...

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.500
...za... kenna!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.380
What is this? It's so murky!

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.430
I'm going to sink!

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:43.400
Zakenna! Swallow them up.

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:46.200
Zakenna!

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:49.340
White!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:50.800
Black!

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:05.150
Zaken-na!

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:06.970
Foolish girls!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.770
Well done, Zakenna!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.150
Zakenna!

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:13.120
Black Thunder!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:15.660
White Thunder!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:24.370
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:27.190
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:33.150
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:39.650
Zakenna!

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.790
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.490
Why, you...!

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:46.640
Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:51.280
Don't think that this is the end.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:09.000
Odajima-san...?

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:09.830
Pull yourself together.

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:13.780
Don't you think that's a masterpiece?

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.270
Black!

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:29.380
What happened to me?

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:30.730
Where am I?

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:46.960
Good morning, Yuka!

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:49.580
Good morning.

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:52.480
Do you think the scribbling all came off?

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:54.400
I'm sure it did.

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:01.900
Nagisa!

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:04.000
What's with her?

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:09.330
Don't tell me that scribbling 
on my face is still there?

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:55.230 --> 00:23:56.180
What am I going to do?

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:57.770
I'm going to do farm work with Fuji-P...!

00:23:57.770 --> 00:23:58.750
I'd better dress up.

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.380
Nagisa... you don't need to 
dress up to do farm work.

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:03.390
They're back again!

00:24:03.390 --> 00:24:05.820
Don't interfere with my fairy tale time!

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:06.640
That's right.

00:24:06.890 --> 00:24:08.980
What do you mean by "fairy tale time"?

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:13.100
"CAPTURE HIS HEART! 
HEART-THROBBING FARM WORK"

00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:15.790
I don't have any courage 
when I need it, do I?

00:24:15.790 --> 00:24:17.600
You're letting your pride stand in the way.

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:20.260
I can't argue with the truth.
